# Build output for the standalone Lite milestone build. Covers every generator-specific
# out-of-source tree: build/ (default), build-qjs/ (QuickJS variant), build-ios/ &
# build-sim/ (iOS device + Simulator Xcode projects), and any future build-<variant>/.
build/
build-*/

# Transient build logs
*.log

# Local capture artifacts
*.png
